<!-- Menu style ElDewrito (it stands for h3/cascade/screen): the two-column cascade picker (1.2.0 menu rework, owner Nov 5: Halo 3's SELECT GAME TYPE,
SELECT MAP and SELECT MISSION, one screen for every lobby - port/linux/game/menu_functions.c cascade_update).
Column 1 the groups (maps, games), column 2 the highlighted group's entries greyed, the list standing over
the column in use; the right panel the focused one's picture, words and author; L and R the game tabs.
The art is this set's own; the pictures and the maps' and missions' words the player's ui.map's. -->
